english:
💰 Coins: ${0}
You earn money by answering correctly, catching EconMon and beating trainers and Gym Leaders; buy congee and items from the hawker. If your whole EconMon team runs out of HP, you lose 30% of your coins on medical fees.
Get 3 answers right in a row for a random item. Hourglasses and hint cards are used while answering; congee can be used here or while answering in battle.

